---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Home
---
<section>
  <p>Welcome. Notes and projects from Narve. My public code lives on <a href="https://github.com/narve">GitHub</a>; the latest side project is <a href="https://narve.github.io/the-presenter/">The Presenter</a>.</p>
</section>

<h2>Posts</h2>
<ul class="post-list">
  {%- set posts = collections.posts | reverse -%}
  {% for post in posts %}
    <li>
      <time datetime="{{ post.date | htmlDateString }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
      <a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
    </li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>
